Example usage:

>>> import tempfile
>>> path = os.path.join(tempfile.gettempdir(), "saved_data")
>>> # Save a dataset
>>> dataset = tf.data.Dataset.range(2)
>>> tf.data.experimental.save(dataset, path)
>>> new_dataset = tf.data.experimental.load(path)
>>> for elem in new_dataset:
